{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "add_project-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### frame\n**To leave:**\n- no Project note for 'P': create_project\n\n**Tools:** `create_project`, `get_note`, `search`, `session_status`, `topics_list`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### ingest\n**To leave:**\n- record what the person already has: update_plan(fields={'ingested': ...}) (a list, or 'none')\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `ingest`, `queue_source`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### map\n**To leave:**\n- record the orientation: search with intent 'orient', then update_plan(fields={'map': ...})\n\n**Tools:** `dispatch_plan`, `get_note`, `read_source_file`, `record_assumptions`, `request_raw_source_access`, `search`, `source_verification_plan`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### need\n**To leave:**\n- open at least one brief: open_brief(need, disqualifiers)\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `open_brief`, `read_source_file`, `record_assumptions`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 1280,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### search\n**To leave:**\n- run rounds until the stopping rule fires: research_round, then checkpoint\n\n**Tools:** `checkpoint`, `get_note`, `ingest`, `queue_source`, `read_source_file`, `research_round`, `search`, `web_search`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 1580,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### judge\n**To leave:**\n- before committing: record what you are assuming and how each was settled - record_assumptions([{assumption, settled_by, how}]), where settled_by is a tool you called here, an answered question's id, or 'unverifiable' (an empty list if you assume nothing)\n\n**Tools:** `add_candidate`, `decide`, `get_note`, `record_assumptions`, `search`, `session_status`, `staging_list`, `staging_review`, `staging_show`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 1880,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### synthesise\n**To leave:**\n- record the cross-source synthesis: record_synthesis\n\n**Tools:** `draft_offering`, `get_note`, `promote_offering`, `record_synthesis`, `record_trace`, `search`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_project-7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 2180,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### check_out\n**To leave:**\n- nothing: advance\n\n**Tools:** `close_brief`, `close_session`, `get_note`, `record_application`, `staging_list`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-add_project",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 2480,
   "label": "add_project session"
