  {
   "id": "apply-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1520,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### check_in\n**To leave:**\n- nothing: advance\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "apply-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1520,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### find\n**To leave:**\n- log the sources you used (log_use), or update_plan(fields={'nothing_found': ...})\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `log_use`, `read_source_file`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "apply-2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1520,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### check_out\n**To leave:**\n- record_application, or update_plan(fields={'no_application': reason})\n\n**Tools:** `close_session`, `get_note`, `record_application`, `staging_list`, `update_plan`"
  },
