  {
   "id": "start_pursuit-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2020,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### frame\n**To leave:**\n- no Project note for 'P': create_project\n\n**Tools:** `create_project`, `get_note`, `search`, `session_status`, `topics_list`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "start_pursuit-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2020,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### inventory\n**To leave:**\n- record the kind-specific inventory: update_plan(fields={'inventory': ...})\n- before committing: record what you are assuming and how each was settled - record_assumptions([{assumption, settled_by, how}]), where settled_by is a tool you called here, an answered question's id, or 'unverifiable' (an empty list if you assume nothing)\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `read_source_file`, `record_assumptions`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "start_pursuit-2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2020,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### plan\n**To leave:**\n- add at least one dated milestone (task_add), or update_plan(fields={'no_dates': reason})\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `search`, `task_add`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "start_pursuit-3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2020,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### seed\n**To leave:**\n- record what was seeded: update_plan(fields={'ingested': ...}) (a list, or 'none')\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `ingest`, `queue_source`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "start_pursuit-4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2020,
   "y": 1280,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### check_out\n**To leave:**\n- nothing: advance\n\n**Tools:** `close_brief`, `close_session`, `get_note`, `record_application`, `staging_list`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-start_pursuit",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 2000,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 1580,
   "label": "start_pursuit session"
  },
  {
   "id": "learn-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### goal\n**To leave:**\n- what do they want to be able to do, and by when: update_plan(fields={'goal': ..., 'deadline': ...})\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "learn-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### baseline\n**To leave:**\n- 2-3 diagnostic questions before teaching: ask_user, then update_plan(fields={'baseline': ...})\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "learn-2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### focus\n**To leave:**\n- read what the library holds, then choose the focus concepts: update_plan(fields={'focus': [...]})\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `read_source_file`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "learn-3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### practice\n**To leave:**\n- nothing: advance\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `read_source_file`, `search`, `understanding_record`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "learn-4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 1280,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### consolidate\n**To leave:**\n- let them explain it in their own words, critique it against the sources, then understanding_record and update_plan(fields={'consolidated': ...})\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `read_source_file`, `search`, `understanding_record`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "learn-5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2520,
   "y": 1580,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### next\n**To leave:**\n- review dates as tasks - task_add(note='<project note>', text='Review: <concept>', due=..., heading='Understanding') - or enable the Spaced Repetition plugin, then update_plan(fields={'scheduled': ...})\n\n**Tools:** `close_session`, `get_note`, `search`, `task_add`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-learn",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 2500,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 1880,
   "label": "learn session"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_capability-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### candidate\n**To leave:**\n- name the candidate: update_plan(fields={'candidate': ...}) - a curated server (capability_candidates) or a repository URL the person gave\n\n**Tools:** `capability_candidates`, `get_note`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_capability-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### assess\n**To leave:**\n- ingest the candidate's repository, so it is read as a source\n- before committing: record what you are assuming and how each was settled - record_assumptions([{assumption, settled_by, how}]), where settled_by is a tool you called here, an answered question's id, or 'unverifiable' (an empty list if you assume nothing)\n\n**Tools:** `get_note`, `ingest`, `read_source_file`, `record_assumptions`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_capability-2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### propose\n**To leave:**\n- propose its exact definition: capability_propose(...)\n\n**Tools:** `capability_propose`, `get_note`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_capability-3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### install\n**To leave:**\n- capability_install(name) - it asks the person; a decline is a finished outcome too\n\n**Tools:** `capability_install`, `get_note`"
  },
  {
   "id": "add_capability-4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3020,
   "y": 1280,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### check_out\n**To leave:**\n- nothing: advance\n\n**Tools:** `close_brief`, `close_session`, `get_note`, `record_application`, `staging_list`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-add_capability",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 3000,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 1580,
   "label": "add_capability session"
  },
  {
   "id": "audited-0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3520,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### manage\n**To leave:**\n- no requirements yet: the person sets them with set_requirement\n\n**Tools:** `audit_projection`, `get_note`, `read_evidence`, `search`, `update_plan`"
  },
  {
   "id": "audited-1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3520,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### preflight\n**To leave:**\n- no contract has been admitted: preflight admits one\n\n**Tools:** `admit_contract`, `audit_projection`"
  },
  {
   "id": "audited-2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3520,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### execute\n**To leave:**\n- no contract has been admitted: preflight admits one\n\n**Tools:** `dispatch_plan`, `get_note`, `read_evidence`, `read_source_file`, `request_raw_source_access`, `search`, `source_verification_plan`, `stage_artifact`"
  },
  {
   "id": "audited-3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3520,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### audit\n**To leave:**\n- no contract has been admitted: preflight admits one\n\n**Tools:** `audit_projection`, `audit_targets`, `verify_grain`"
  },
  {
   "id": "audited-4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3520,
   "y": 1280,
   "width": 400,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "### reduce\n**To leave:**\n- no contract has been admitted: preflight admits one\n\n**Tools:** `audit_projection`, `close_session`, `reduce_round`"
  },
  {
   "id": "g-audited",
   "type": "group",
   "x": 3500,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 1580,
   "label": "audited session"
  }
